<channel|>Most Warlocks prefer the **Voidwalker** because it acts as a reliable **tank**. 

While the Succubus deals more damage, the Voidwalker's **Torment** and **Suffering** ensure mobs stay focused on the pet rather than the Warlock. This prevents the Warlock from taking damage, allowing them to level safely and efficiently without constant interruption or death. [end of text]


